        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YOWN-NIL, Yale Expressions Nils Lever with Modern Owen Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Nils Leverset with Owen Rose is a stunningly contemporary lever with one of the hottest designs. This modern door lever is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions. The Yale Expressions Nils Lever with Modern Owen Rosette will fit 5-1/2 inch center to center prep and comes packaged with an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Nils Door Lever with Modern Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Nils Leverset with Owen Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry has a Schlage C keyway.</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YOWN-NIL-specifications.pdf?v=1704262435\"><b>Yale YOWN-NIL Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. \r\nLever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face). Package Includes: \r\n2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch \r\noperates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, \r\nstrike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. \r\nLatch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock \r\non both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Package Includes: \r\n2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Keyed:</b> Guarded latchbolt operated from outside by key; inside by lever. \r\nTurnbutton on the interior locks outside lever. Outside lever unlocks by key. \r\nComplete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Nils Leverset with Owen Rose",
                "description": "The Modern Nils Leverset with Owen Rose is a stunningly contemporary lever with one of the hottest designs. This modern door lever is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions. The Yale Expressions Nils Lever with Modern Owen Rosette will fit 5-1/2 inch center to center prep and comes packaged with an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches.",
